      en: ["Birni-Nkonni is the primary gateway to the Nigerian state of Sokoto.", "The city is situated at the junction of the N1 and N25 national highways.", "The name 'Birni' means 'city' or 'fortified place' in the Hausa language.", "It houses one of the busiest border crossings and customs posts in Niger.", "The town's economy is almost entirely driven by cross-border commerce.", "Historically, Birni-Nkonni was a key settlement in the Ader region."],
