      en: ["Major agricultural hub located in the Maradi Region.", "Primary center for cowpea (niébé) production and trade.", "Boasts one of the largest grain markets in the southern region.", "Located in an area with relatively high annual rainfall for Niger.", "Serves as a regional focal point for healthcare and education.", "Inhabited primarily by sedentary Hausa farming communities."],
